# Author: rgbohner (with Codex assistance)
# Date: 2026-11-20
# Used for: Lists placeholder API keys and optional provider settings.
# Why: Gives developers a safe template for their Git-ignored local secrets.

# Copy to .env (setup.sh does this) and fill in your own API key.
# .env is ignored by Git. Never commit real credentials.
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Optional Gemini recognition:
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
# COLLECTION_AI_PROVIDER=gemini

# Optional model overrides:
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4.1-mini
# OPENAI_RESEARCH_MODEL=gpt-6.1-terra
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.8-flash
